{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13200","headline":"使往寿州淮路寄刘长卿 · 皇甫冉","name":"使往寿州淮路寄刘长卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"榛草荒凉村落空，驱驰卒岁亦何功。\n蒹葭曙色苍苍远，蟋蟀秋声处处同。\n乡路遥知淮浦外，故人多在楚云东。\n日夕烟霜那可道，寿阳西去水无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}